Basalt OS artwork (logos, icons, boot splash, GRUB theme, wallpapers)
Copyright the Basalt OS project authors.

The artwork in this package is licensed under the Creative Commons
Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International license (CC-BY-SA-4.0):
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/

The names "Basalt OS" and "OpenBasalt" and the Basalt mark identify the
Basalt OS project. Distributions derived from Basalt OS that are not
published by the project should replace this package with their own
artwork (as generic-logos does for derivatives of Fedora).

The wordmark outlines and the key hints image of the GRUB theme were drawn
with the Inter typeface (https://rsms.me/inter/), licensed under the SIL
Open Font License 1.1 (Inter-OFL.txt next to this file). No font files are
included: the GRUB theme uses the font built into GRUB itself.
